Subject: [PATCH 10/10] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...ee where S is __TreeKeyedStorage, S.Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...avigation.swift => __Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage.swift} | 0
 ...wift => __Tree where S is ~Copyable, S is __TreeStorage.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Tree Keyed/{Tree.Keyed.ForEach.swift => __Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage, S.Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Tree Keyed/{Tree.Keyed.Navigation.swift => __Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Tree Keyed/{Tree.Keyed.FrontDoor.swift => __Tree where S is ~Copyable, S is __TreeStorage.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.ForEach.swift b/Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage, S.Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.ForEach.swift
rename to Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage, S.Element is Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.Navigation.swift b/Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.Navigation.swift
rename to Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is __TreeKeyedStorage.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.FrontDoor.swift b/Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is ~Copyable, S is __TreeStorage.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Tree Keyed/Tree.Keyed.FrontDoor.swift
rename to Sources/Tree Keyed/__Tree where S is ~Copyable, S is __TreeStorage.swift
